      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso (recto in Ferrario's edition)",
          "value": "<p>(folio 1, ln. 19-26)</p>\n<p>...the fact that the aforementioned administrators [of Ibrahim Bey] entered by force the country house of the undersigned [Jacub Dayyan] and took from the stable the two cows in his property and sequestered them...</p>\n<p>(folio 1, ln. 32-40)</p>\n<p>...[the administrators of the Bey recognized] the seriousness of their actions against an Italian subject and knowing at the same time the serious consequences that could derive from their misdeeds...</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
